se,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XA8R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed53d5b9-e889-4919-84d3-0621ec3ff0e1","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"wingetでVimがインストールできるようになってたからNeovimもインストールできるのかなと思ったらリポジトリに存在しなかった…。","ts":"1629712549.090600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gunnyari","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FGFzG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8a43e5e-594a-4843-ba16-e09927fe1185","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"たぶん上の書籍にも出てくるんじゃないですかね。","ts":"1629697634.089000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E3My"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cb41c05-a789-4c39-8210-bd8a9cf8ad1b","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"有名なのがそれですね。AkkaをRustに移植したのが「Actix」です。","ts":"1629697603.088500","edited":{"user":"U022PB40WAF","ts":"1629697708.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tgc4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c4e83f3-f685-4148-a49b-02882ea8b3e9","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"Scalaのakkaってもので出てきてたっけな＞アクターモデル","ts":"1629697436.088000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fhNH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06d80618-e695-4fdf-9b51-7520d58227ee","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"CSP/Goも並行処理ですぜ。アクターモデルではないけど","ts":"1629697047.087200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZS3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e90dd7d-c352-4b78-9030-7645ffc28fbc","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"「アクターモデル」というのが出てきたら並行処理みたいです。(Concurrentと書かれている）\n\u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Actor_model\u003e","ts":"1629696864.086800","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: Actor model","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/","title":"Actor model","title_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Actor_model","text":"The actor model in computer science is a mathematical model of concurrent computation that treats actor as the universal primitive of concurrent computation. In response to a message it receives, an actor can: make local decisions, create more actors, send more messages, and determine how to respond to the next message received. Actors may modify their own private state, but can only affect each other indirectly through messaging (removing the need for lock-based synchronization).\nThe actor model originated in 1973. It has been used both as a framework for a theoretical understanding of computation and as the theoretical basis for several practical implementations of concurrent systems. The relationship of the model to other work is discussed in actor model and process calculi.","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Actor_model","original_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Actor_model"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M1y7h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"760a10a4-22e5-4249-ac6f-12f9a5666eed","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"concurrentとparallelなら一瞬でわかる、単語として似てないというのは地味に大事...!","ts":"1629696581.085800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U011WJ8K6UU"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2nxiW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b250db6-4c80-43b1-bae2-dfee7c26dcb6","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"平行と並列いっつもどっちがどっちかわからなくなるので、concurrentとparallelどっちなのか聞き返すケースが多い気がします","ts":"1629696551.085100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KGb4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ae7d784-3d7f-4df9-bc89-8e1c71f1dc95"